<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18436" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφομοι-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make like,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					9.9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς γράμμασι τὰ ἔργα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Cra.</u>
					427c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαινομένοις . . ἀ. αὑτούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					396a
				</span></i>
			; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν θεῶν] τὰ εἴδη ἑαυτοῖς ἀ. οἱ
					ἄνθρωποι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1252b27
				</span></i>
			:—also in 
				Med.
			 or 
				Pass.
			, <i>become</i> or <i>be made like,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					396b
				</span></i>
			, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Sph.</u>
					240a
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>compare,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					517b
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				564b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> c. acc.
			rei, <i>portray,</i> of painters, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				3.10.2
			</span></i>: abs., <i>make a copy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cra.</u>
				424d
			</span></i>.</div>
